			<title>Update on Book Funding / Publishing</title>
			<link>http://lancetrumbull.com/news/93-update-on-book-funding--publishing.html</link>
			<guid>http://lancetrumbull.com/news/93-update-on-book-funding--publishing.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<p><img src="http://lancetrumbull.com/images/stories/everest_beauty_cover_websitesml.jpg" border="0" alt="Sample image" title="Sample image" align="left" /></p>
<p>Update on Kickstarter / Funding Campaign:</p>
<p>Unfortunately, we did not reach our funding goal. I am still working on Plan B, which is of course to find an alternative way to get the book published. The book is done, and it will happen, I guarentee it. Stay tuned...</p>
]]></description>
			<author>everestpeaceproject@gmail.com (Administrator)</author>
			<category>Latest</category>
